  "body": "Currently requestDevice() defines two behaviors--connect and discovery services, after that I assume it cached everything, and API doesn't provide discover service method. It doesn't give applications refresh service lists.\nSuppose there is one Bluetooth Smart device with 3 sensors, when we connect with the device, only one sensor is being activated, so only one Thermometer Service shows up, and we only cache one service. I guess it's possible to activate other sensors and the device update service list again, in this case, the application may need to discovery service again.\n",
